ghareeb e Zahra ka zee'n par sambhalna mushkil tha<br />
Ali o Zahra ko rann mein rulaya jaata tha<br />
Hussain girte nahi the giraya jaata tha</p>

<p>Haaye,<br />
Laga jo teer to asghar ko sheh ne yaad kiya<br />
